<title>USA: TABLE - Veeco Instruments Inc Q2 net down.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Veeco Instruments Inc Q2 net down.</headline>
<dateline>PLAINVIEW, N.Y. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>								June 30,</p>
<p>						     1997	     1996</p>
<p> Net sales				$    33,867     $    25,095</p>
<p> Gross Profit				  15,069	    11,123</p>
<p>   Research and development expense     3,561	     2,579</p>
