<p>NOTE - (a) Net income includes a one-time in-process research and development charge of about $4.2 million from the acquisition of certain assets from Materials Research Corp ($2.6 million net of tax or $0.42 per share).</p>
<p>Excluding such charge, Q2 net income would be $0.49 per share versus $0.35 per share. Income for the six-month period would have been $0.92 per share versus $0.66 per share.</p>
